      "doc": "Create a vault holding `initial_deposit` of `token`. The caller\\nmust have pre-approved the vault contract to spend at least\\n`initial_deposit` of the token, OR the token must accept\\n`require_auth` from `owner` (the standard Stellar Asset Contract\\npath).\\n\\n`unlock_timestamp` is recorded immutably; it can only ever be\\nPUSHED FORWARD via `extend_lock`.",
